BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (percent of the bid, so a $525,500 opening bid means a $52,500 check. Gross tells clients to make it payable to escrow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (when the rules allow. A check made out to the estate lands in the estate's bank account, and the buyer cannot claw it) Tj ET
