BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (little-known angle for buyer's agents is the overbid commission. The entire commission on the overbid increase goes to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (the overbidder's side instead of being split with the listing agent. In his example that is an extra $2,500 on a $100,000) Tj ET
