BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.55 Tm (heirs shut off utilities to save money, then eat the equivalent of a full first-floor replacement when one cold snap burst) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 223.32 Tm (the pipes; Burt's fix is a full winterization that drains every line, not dripping faucets, or heat held between 55 and 60) Tj ET
