BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.30 Tm (Attorneys spell out what burns a relationship. Miami attorney Sylvana lists a transactional approach and letting listings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.07 Tm (sit while estate funds burn. Sylvana adds emailing "five, six times a day," acting entitled, and asking favors without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.85 Tm (giving value [kOa87jAYRNs @ 00:19:39]. The Probate Mastery host warns that pitching yourself as a specialist makes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.62 Tm (you look like a threat who needs their referrals. Promised volume must stay moderate, because "if I overstate it they) Tj ET
