BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (known early [S5zYm8kcrug @ 00:01:54].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The second point of agreement is that the family, not the house, is the hard part. Christine describes first-time families) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (hitting 'a tidal wave of decisions,' and the All About Seniors team tours communities in person with every family) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (because pictures do not tell the whole story [1kkoh35VCho @ 00:00:18]. Coleman's rule is that one person in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (family must be the designated contact; the agents are outsiders with a job to do and cannot interact with every relative) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm ([yyvDp4R_T84 @ 00:02:16]. Coleman also says that if there is too much chaos, if the family or loved one is in denial,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (or if nobody has legal standing, there is nothing the team can do until the family finds a remedy [yyvDp4R_T84 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (00:02:56]. Corpus reports the same friction from the Bay Area: some relatives want a quick sale while others resist the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (change, and packing up a lifetime of belongings stalls some families for months or even years because they don't know) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (where to start [S5zYm8kcrug @ 00:04:48]. The fix both land on is an outside handler, whether a placement agent,) Tj ET
